OL,3,AReform pledges to suspend UK's asylum
OL,4,Asystem for up to five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has announced plans to
OL,7,Feffectively close down the UK's asylum
OL,8,Fsystem for a full parliamentary term if
OL,9,Felected.
OL,11,FThe party said all new asylum
OL,12,Fapplications would be rejected and
OL,13,Fexisting applications voided, with all
OL,14,Fclaimants marked for deportation. It
OL,15,Fsaid no grants of humanitarian
OL,16,Fprotection or refugee status would be
OL,17,Fmade, while legal refugee routes and
OL,18,Fresettlement schemes would end.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
