OL,3,AReform pledges to suspend UK's asylum
OL,4,Asystem for up to five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform said it would also scrap the
OL,7,Fasylum tribunal system and deport
OL,8,F90,000 people currently with appeal
OL,9,Fcases, with home affairs spokesman Zia
OL,10,FYusuf saying "Britain is full".
OL,12,FLabour called the proposals a "clear
OL,13,Fsign of desperation and weakness" and
OL,14,Fthe Refugee Council branded them
OL,15,F"unworkable".
